  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package spaghetti",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1.25 pounds shrimp, peeled and deveined",
    "1 splash dry white wine",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh basil",
    "salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 tablespoon grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8jh6ER7-tpAXLfCkVjPJiePSwGM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-263408-creamy-shrimp-pasta-VAT-step-01-1b821f6a3d76407a84b7ef3c9b6a091a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263408/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook pasta in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/njN9iCbvm7kFoDwVR5-LTUsODmc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-263408-creamy-shrimp-pasta-VAT-step-02-3b512c71dc9c453b9cb2f12d4bcefd6a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263408/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While spaghetti is cooking, heat oil in a large skillet over medium-low heat. Cook garlic until soft, but not brown, about 1 minute. Add shrimp and cook until opaque, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JHphOGbH_7luIhuzI0Izs2TrfAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-263408-creamy-shrimp-pasta-VAT-step-03-a2b89b695b054b55990bcfda8c083538.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263408/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add wine, reduce heat, and pour in cream. Simmer until sauce starts to thicken, 3 to 5 minutes. Stir in basil and season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DbnOmRmlAIXXuDsZ1VJeR86GjVQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-263408-creamy-shrimp-pasta-VAT-step-04-ac9da7d0f3c54f13b4c1c9f56e1fc2f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263408/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain spaghetti and spoon creamy shrimp on top. Serve with Parmesan cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
